","README.md":"# Bili R9 first current-baseline install and state

The exact signed APK from actual build02 is installed once with -R after all-users absence checks. The actual R5 host source and its 26 controls, new helper 21 scope/Session controls, original 22 Java idle and 32 Python idle controls are required. The exact 14 current host runtime files are copied into a fresh private source directory. Initialization uses the typed current baseline; old deployment receipts are historical lineage only.

The original nine Android commands, action lock, held namespace entry, APK staging identity and independent FD cleanup remain. One state request uses the new 32-hex actual nonce and does not connect UiAutomation. No launch, inspect, text, player action, permissions or commercial data mutation is requested. Failed or uncertain installation is not automatically retried or uninstalled. The owned helper UID is unknown until actual installation.

The coordinator guarantees only its directly owned child join; the native helper's whole-process-tree cleanup qualification remains false. Current commercial APK business acceptance and the framework SIGKILL sender remain unresolved.
